    "show_share": true,
    "description": "To highlight the immense contribution of nurses and midwives to health care, the Aga Khan University celebrated International Nurses Day and the International Day of the Midwife on Monday, May 12, 2014. This year's themes for the two days were 'Nurses: A force for change - a vital resource for health' and 'Midwives: changing the world one family at a time'.",
